-- Optional staff help entry; does not run a promotion.
'Senior staff, on build or live:\r\nzpromote <zone> check - Preview the saved build-to-live file changes.\r\nzpromote <zone>       - Back up live, then promote the saved build zone.\r\nzpromote <zone> backups - List backup IDs, newest first.\r\nzpromote <zone> restore <backup-ID> [check] - Restore a saved snapshot.\r\nEvery restore backs up the current live zone first. check only previews.\r\nRestore verifies checksums and preserves other zones in live indexes.\r\n\r\nSave pending OLC edits first. All eight zone file types and index membership\r\nare mirrored. Optional files absent on build are removed from live after backup.\r\nLive zone files and indexes are backed up to lib/zone-backups/<zone>/\r\nwith UTC dates and times in their filenames. The command reports the backup path.\r\nOrdinary copy errors roll back replacements and retain the backup.\r\n\r\nThis command copies files; it does not reload or restart live. Reload/restart\r\nlive before saving or editing that zone there.\r\n',33,1000,FALSE);
